/P 187 0 R
/E (A patient whose PSA hasn't risen yet is NOT the same as a patient who will never recur. A clinician sees a post-treatment PSA value and asks: "Is this good news or just early?" We don't know whether to intensify treatment, switch therapy, or wait.)
